### Three-Star Rating

Award up to three stars per level.

Example:

* Three stars: Excellent parking with minimal damage and high accuracy.
* Two stars: Successful parking with a few mistakes.
* One star: Successful parking with significant penalties.

Define configurable thresholds for each level.

### High-Score Dashboard

Track:

* Highest score per level.
* Best completion time.
* Best parking accuracy.
* Lowest damage.
* Total levels completed.
* Total stars collected.
* Total coins earned.
* Number of vehicles owned.
* Overall campaign completion percentage.

Allow players to replay completed levels to beat their previous records.

Save the best valid result for each level and update the records when the player achieves a better performance.

