### Final Instruction to the AI Developer

Build the game in functional stages, starting with the 3D driving environment and core vehicle physics. Then implement the parking validation system, level progression, rewards, vehicle store, upgrades, UI, animations, and persistence.

Prioritize **playability, realistic controls, correct game logic, and stable performance** over decorative features.

